1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The stage lights come up at 3:07. Every night.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,000
The caretaker has stopped asking why.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,000
Even a condemned theatre keeps its appointments.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,500
<i>Somebody is still in the third row.</i>
